Yes, I totally agree.  That's why we have different classes.  But the
particular *type* of imbalance this causes is not useful -- it makes all
of the moderate classes much too hard (or, rather, luck-dependant; easy if
they get the right artifact with their one or two shots, and hard if they
don't.)  There should be a spectrum of difficulty, and this seems to clear
out the middle of the spectrum a bit too much.

> I just don't want to encourage people to stick around on
