> bored with sac-fests as I am."

People will still do sac-fests for the other benefits.  Again, what this
does is removes an interesting choice -- do you keep sac'ing, or pray for
benefits?  Well, if you've already gotten your gift, now you're going to
go all prayer.  Again, that's a Bad Thing (TM).  Instead of adding choices
this takes them away.

