Again, I think this sort of reduces the usefulness and interestingness of
this patch.  It's already hard to get artifacts, and now you may also lose
them... it feels very, very restrictive.

Nethack is all about giving you choices -- a lot of ways to do things, a
lot of ways to combine equipment and strategies to be successful.  One
might use GDSM - robe - "oR, or SDSM - CoMR - "oLS/ESP, or GDSM -
ShieldoR - "oMB, or quite a few other combinations depending on what
particular effects they're seeking and what's available.  But if they only
have one choice in any given game, it's not very interesting.  What makes
it interesting is that I can choose -- do I enchant the GDS or do I wait
for a silver dragon?  Do I hang on to the shield of reflection or do I
switch to the amulet and #twoweapon?

I think the same is true for weapons.  The weapons you've listed here -- 
it would sometimes be a tough choice as to what to wield, what to enchant,
and what to drop.  But if there is no choice because I only have one
artifact and can't get another, what fun is that?

